IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-LORAFLOW-MIGRATE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-MODULES         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 MODULE-SIZE-KB      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 LATENCY-US-X10      PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 BANDWIDTH-GBPS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LORAFLOW.
    MOVE 162 TO LATENCY-US-X10.
    MOVE 64 TO BANDWIDTH-GBPS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-MODULES.
    WEIGHT 30 BANDWIDTH-GBPS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
